homelab-prometheus (0.10.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fleet-basics: RootDiskGrowingFast (post-cutover #110). RootDiskFilling only
    fires at 85% full, so the three 2026-11 log floods (#104/#105/#110) were
    each seen near the end. This fires within the hour when a host loses more
    than 100 MB of free root space in an hour, sustained 30 min -- above normal
    churn, below every one of those floods -- so a runaway writer is caught
    early. Points at install-orchestrators/fleet-log-rate.sh.

