homelab-prometheus (0.10.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * dns-ipv6 rules (post-cutover #64, closed 2026-11-12): DnsIPv6FrontendIdle
    stays; ResolverIPv6Idle dropped before it was ever deployed. ns03 stays
    IPv4-only by decision (its clients reach it over IPv4 and get AAAA
    answers through it), so that rule would have fired forever. The edges'
    IPv6 listeners get about one query in nine without any registry glue,
    so the frontend rule is meaningful from day one.

